
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Auto Mount Enabled                 	N/A                 	N/A       
BlockSize                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Capacity                           	N/A                 	N/A       
Compressed                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Dirty Bit Set                      	N/A                 	N/A       
Drive Letter                       	N/A                 	N/A       
DriveType                          	N/A                 	N/A       
File System                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Free Space                         	N/A                 	N/A       
ID                                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Indexing Enabled                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Label                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Maximum File Name Length           	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Quotas Enabled                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Quotas Incomplete                  	N/A                 	N/A       
Quotas Rebuilding                  	N/A                 	N/A       
Serial Number                      	N/A                 	N/A       
Supports Disk Quotas               	N/A                 	N/A       
Supports File Based Compression    	N/A                 	N/A       
SystemName                         	N/A                 	N/A       

